<tr><th>Session</th><th>Focus</th><th>Status</th></tr>
<tr><td>Video 143</td><td>TreeSet properties, constructors, String natural sort, StringBuffer CCE, null rules, Comparable/compareTo</td><td>✅ Prerequisite</td></tr>
